{
  "Name": "CLQ002_AxessPatientChartRetrieval",
  "ProjectType": "Process",
  "Description": "The process involves accessing the Axxess portal to retrieve and prepare task allocation reports. A final chart report is prepared by retaining only the OASIS-related records and removing all other task types. It then references the notes section to identify records marked as OASIS completed and removes their corresponding chart data , a summary chart report is generated to facilitate task allocation.",
